[Desktop Entry]
Version=1.0
Type=Application
Name=Zoth OS v3.4.0
Comment=Debian 13 + KDE Plasma 6.3 sovereign AI distro. Kali + Parrot parity, Studio v2, Ollama on 127.0.0.1, 163 MCP servers all off. Eight named v
